WEBVTT

00:01.007 --> 00:03.387
[♪ mysterious music playing]

00:23.867 --> 00:24.867
[both gasp]

00:25.327 --> 00:26.787
[cape rustling]

00:30.367 --> 00:32.377
[gasps]

00:32.457 --> 00:33.747
[grunts]

00:38.877 --> 00:41.337
[Patchwork Bear 1 growling]

00:44.177 --> 00:46.177
[roaring]

00:46.267 --> 00:48.477
-[Elymas grunting]
-[sword slashing]

00:50.847 --> 00:53.017
[grunts, yells]

01:01.527 --> 01:03.527
-[gasps]
-[monster grunting]

01:03.607 --> 01:05.407
-[monster growls]
-[Elymas grunts]

01:05.987 --> 01:08.657
-[sword slashes]
-[monster groaning]

01:14.587 --> 01:17.127
[Ruche panting]

01:18.127 --> 01:19.917
[RUCHE] Acrobatic Amble!

01:21.627 --> 01:23.967
[panting]

01:24.547 --> 01:25.677
[grunts]

01:25.757 --> 01:28.057
-[Golden Raana croaks]
-[Ruche giggles]

01:28.137 --> 01:31.807
Doppellusion!

01:34.397 --> 01:35.307
[gasps]

01:35.397 --> 01:36.817
[croaking]

01:38.187 --> 01:39.857
[croaking]

01:43.067 --> 01:44.197
[grunts]

01:48.537 --> 01:49.987
[croaks]

01:54.207 --> 01:55.617
[grunts]

01:56.337 --> 01:57.627
[ELYMAS] Shadow Stomp!

01:57.707 --> 01:58.917
[struggling]

01:58.997 --> 02:01.007
[panting]

02:04.217 --> 02:06.047
Dice Thrust!

02:06.547 --> 02:07.717
[grunts]

02:07.797 --> 02:09.677
[yells]

02:11.767 --> 02:12.767
[grunts]

02:16.847 --> 02:18.317
[squeals excitedly]

02:18.397 --> 02:19.607
[grunting]

02:20.357 --> 02:21.477
[AUTOMATED VOICE] Critical.

02:23.107 --> 02:24.197
[Ruche grunts]

02:29.157 --> 02:30.407
[grunts]

02:31.697 --> 02:33.747
[Golden Raana groans, thuds]

02:35.247 --> 02:37.537
[ELYMAS] The only possible way
I'll be able to beat it

02:37.627 --> 02:39.627
is to throw
three more Magic Stones.

02:39.707 --> 02:42.297
But Dreamlords
regenerate very quickly.

02:42.377 --> 02:45.127
If I take too long, I'm screwed.

02:45.217 --> 02:46.677
[gasps]

02:46.757 --> 02:49.757
[Embryo babbles, laughs]

02:49.847 --> 02:52.347
[ELYMAS] No way.
It shouldn't use Sylph Cutter

02:52.427 --> 02:54.057
with us positioned like this!

02:54.137 --> 02:55.887
[Embryo screeches]

02:56.767 --> 02:58.187
[Elymas gasps]

02:59.227 --> 03:00.267
It's no use.

03:01.267 --> 03:02.607
I can't dodge it!

03:04.357 --> 03:07.487
[Elymas yelling]

03:10.407 --> 03:11.537
[screaming]

03:14.617 --> 03:16.207
[grunting]

03:17.037 --> 03:18.167
[screams]

03:26.877 --> 03:28.757
[laughing]

03:28.837 --> 03:31.757
[Elymas groans]
I'm losing consciousness.

03:33.887 --> 03:35.387
- [heart thumping]
- My heart

03:35.477 --> 03:37.727
is pounding out of my chest.

03:38.727 --> 03:41.017
And I can feel my legs
growing weaker.

03:41.857 --> 03:43.067
[heart thumping]

03:45.567 --> 03:47.697
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Status effect, Stunned.

03:47.777 --> 03:49.027
[ELYMAS] I see.

03:50.107 --> 03:52.657
In a situation like this,
a stun is fatal.

03:52.737 --> 03:54.157
[straining weakly]

03:54.237 --> 03:55.117
Who knows?

03:56.287 --> 03:59.167
Maybe my starting Luck value
was set too low.

04:01.787 --> 04:05.167
Well, Ruche,
I should have asked you to stay.

04:05.257 --> 04:07.877
Come on.
Let's defeat it together!

04:17.927 --> 04:19.347
[RUCHE] Did ya call for me?

04:20.767 --> 04:22.017
[straining]

04:23.017 --> 04:23.977
[gasps]

04:24.267 --> 04:26.317
Thanks for asking me
to join your party!

04:27.237 --> 04:28.857
[Embryo babbling]

04:31.277 --> 04:33.487
Doppellusion!

04:40.247 --> 04:42.707
♪

04:43.377 --> 04:45.207
Wait. What are you doing here?

04:45.297 --> 04:48.627
I thought you took those guys
and fled this dungeon! [gasps]

04:48.707 --> 04:52.047
[Ruche sobbing]

04:52.137 --> 04:53.087
[gasps]

04:53.717 --> 04:55.307
[RUCHE] There's just one path
out of here.

04:55.387 --> 04:57.807
And I sensed
you weren't following us.

04:58.427 --> 04:59.887
So I made sure those two

04:59.977 --> 05:01.307
made it somewhere
they'd be safe.

05:01.387 --> 05:03.607
Then I hurried back
to check on you.

05:04.227 --> 05:07.067
[sobs] You said
you'd just buy us time.

05:07.147 --> 05:09.067
So what made you stay back
and keep fighting

05:09.147 --> 05:11.317
instead of running away?

05:11.397 --> 05:12.277
I was...

05:13.867 --> 05:15.027
being stubborn.

05:16.277 --> 05:18.447
You have to turn back,
all right?

05:19.117 --> 05:20.997
[Ruche crying] No way!

05:22.327 --> 05:25.247
I'm staying.
We can be stubborn together!

05:26.547 --> 05:27.747
[gasps]

05:27.837 --> 05:29.457
[whimpering]

05:32.507 --> 05:33.637
[ELYMAS] No. Don't touch those.

05:33.717 --> 05:35.837
I want you to pick up
every single coin

05:35.927 --> 05:36.927
you toss down there.

05:37.427 --> 05:39.597
-[Cline grunts angrily]
-What's the matter with you?

05:39.677 --> 05:41.477
You honestly thought
you could throw them

05:41.557 --> 05:44.187
all over the ground
and say it's some kind of gift?

05:44.977 --> 05:47.817
[RUCHE] You helped me
when no one else would.

05:49.727 --> 05:50.937
♪

05:52.947 --> 05:54.567
You risked your own life

05:54.657 --> 05:57.317
just so I could have a chance
of escaping unharmed.

05:57.407 --> 05:59.157
Now go. Get them outside!

05:59.947 --> 06:01.697
[RUCHE] From the moment
I joined your party,

06:01.787 --> 06:03.367
you said you needed my powers.

06:04.037 --> 06:06.877
So I won't abandon you! [sobs]

06:06.957 --> 06:08.207
[gasps]

06:08.297 --> 06:10.377
If I were the type
to run away...

06:11.957 --> 06:14.797
then I'd have quit adventuring
a long time ago!

06:14.887 --> 06:16.467
[gasps]

06:18.717 --> 06:19.887
[both gasp]

06:25.347 --> 06:28.107
But I only had
one effective attack,

06:28.187 --> 06:30.147
and it isn't going
to work anymore.

06:30.227 --> 06:32.067
For us to reach the Embryo,

06:32.147 --> 06:34.697
we need long-range skills
that we don't have.

06:34.777 --> 06:37.527
After all you've done,
you're just giving up?!

06:38.737 --> 06:40.617
Even when
I called myself useless,

06:41.697 --> 06:43.447
you still relied on me

06:43.537 --> 06:45.707
and saw the potential
that I had inside.

06:45.787 --> 06:47.127
[ELYMAS] It's all right.

06:47.207 --> 06:49.627
[gasps] Ruche, I...

06:49.707 --> 06:51.627
[whimpering]

06:53.167 --> 06:56.637
Truth is, I need you
more than you know.

07:00.307 --> 07:04.137
[sighs] So now, you should
let me help you again.

07:09.767 --> 07:12.107
[Embryo babbling]

07:20.657 --> 07:21.737
Doppellusion.

07:23.497 --> 07:24.697
[ELYMAS] I see.

07:24.787 --> 07:26.907
Ruche is far more
than I imagined.

07:26.997 --> 07:28.707
[♪ rousing music playing]

07:31.417 --> 07:33.457
-Help me, Ruche.
-[gasps]

07:35.877 --> 07:38.297
Because I need your power
more than ever.

07:42.757 --> 07:44.257
[chuckles happily]

07:44.347 --> 07:45.517
♪

07:49.897 --> 07:52.437
We'll beat the Embryo
side by side!

07:52.517 --> 07:54.727
Yeah! Let's do this, Mr. Elymas!

07:56.067 --> 07:58.027
[♪ opening theme song playing]

09:31.207 --> 09:32.997
♪

09:34.627 --> 09:35.497
[grunts]

09:36.037 --> 09:37.207
Hey, they're coming!

09:37.287 --> 09:39.377
[Elymas grunts, pants]

09:41.127 --> 09:42.217
[ELYMAS] Shield Bash!

09:43.257 --> 09:44.177
[grunts]

09:45.257 --> 09:46.347
Now, Ruche!

09:46.427 --> 09:48.347
[panting]

09:48.427 --> 09:51.347
[yells]

09:55.057 --> 09:57.977
I've got this.
I know I can do it.

09:58.067 --> 10:00.647
[Embryo growls]

10:00.737 --> 10:02.147
[both gasp]

10:02.237 --> 10:03.357
[Embryo roars]

10:16.287 --> 10:17.377
[exclaims]

10:18.787 --> 10:20.837
[RUCHE] This feels like
it'll never end.

10:22.667 --> 10:26.177
Yeah. Trying to defeat
the Tin Knights is pointless.

10:26.257 --> 10:27.217
We can't beat them.

10:27.297 --> 10:29.257
Not in a drawn-out fight.

10:30.347 --> 10:32.517
We should focus
on taking down the Embryo.

10:32.597 --> 10:33.477
[Ruche gasps]

10:34.847 --> 10:36.397
Do you have a new strategy?

10:37.107 --> 10:39.727
-Mm. I just might.
-[gasps]

10:39.817 --> 10:41.937
Attack it with your Dice Thrust.

10:42.027 --> 10:43.237
That's the best chance we have.

10:44.857 --> 10:47.237
If you miss this, it's over.

10:47.947 --> 10:49.697
There's a one in six chance.

10:49.777 --> 10:51.697
And the whole thing
comes down to your luck.

10:53.197 --> 10:54.907
When the Embryo's eye is closed,

10:54.997 --> 10:57.957
the fleshy armor covering it
has 88 Defense.

11:00.497 --> 11:01.747
And when your Dice Thrust

11:01.837 --> 11:03.757
landed crits
against the Golden Raana,

11:03.837 --> 11:06.127
you pierced its 200 Defense.

11:06.217 --> 11:07.717
So it proves you can deal

11:07.797 --> 11:09.547
massive damage
through brute force.

11:11.507 --> 11:13.597
There's no need
for the standard strategy.

11:13.677 --> 11:16.137
We should be able to destroy
the Embryo without that.

11:16.227 --> 11:18.147
But it's up so high!

11:18.227 --> 11:20.147
How am I ever
supposed to get up there?

11:20.937 --> 11:21.977
[gasps]

11:22.397 --> 11:24.357
[panting]

11:33.907 --> 11:34.827
[grunts]

11:34.907 --> 11:36.787
Acrobatic Amble!

11:36.867 --> 11:38.497
No. If you tried that,

11:38.577 --> 11:40.127
you'd make yourself
the perfect target

11:40.207 --> 11:41.127
for its Sylph Cutter.

11:41.207 --> 11:43.207
Uh, then what are we gonna do?

11:43.297 --> 11:45.297
I can close the gap between us.

11:45.377 --> 11:46.297
Huh?

11:47.967 --> 11:49.507
[ELYMAS]
Just be ready to follow up.

11:51.887 --> 11:53.057
If it all goes as planned,

11:53.677 --> 11:55.387
I can use Shield Bash
to send you flying

11:55.477 --> 11:57.427
directly within striking range.

11:57.517 --> 11:58.557
[gasps]

11:58.637 --> 12:00.057
This carries a lot of risk,
though.

12:00.147 --> 12:01.397
[gasps]

12:02.267 --> 12:03.647
If we fall short,

12:03.727 --> 12:05.857
neither of us
will walk out of here alive.

12:06.647 --> 12:07.687
[whimpers]

12:10.237 --> 12:11.157
[gasps]

12:12.157 --> 12:13.907
[Embryo laughing]

12:16.117 --> 12:18.407
Gotta roll a six on Dice Thrust.

12:19.667 --> 12:20.577
All right.

12:21.167 --> 12:23.127
If that's our only choice,

12:23.207 --> 12:24.587
we ought to give it
our best try.

12:24.667 --> 12:25.757
So then,

12:26.507 --> 12:29.417
don't you worry.
I promise I'm rolling a six.

12:30.087 --> 12:31.637
Well, good luck, Ruche.

12:31.717 --> 12:34.387
I'm counting on you
more than ever this time.

12:35.347 --> 12:36.257
[grunts]

12:37.227 --> 12:38.307
Right!

12:41.597 --> 12:44.107
[ELYMAS] Vital Slice!

12:44.187 --> 12:45.937
Now, Ruche! Jump!

12:46.017 --> 12:48.147
[Ruche grunts]

12:49.987 --> 12:51.907
-[ELYMAS] Shield Bash!
-[Ruche grunts]

12:52.867 --> 12:55.157
-[yells]
-[ELYMAS] So far, so good.

12:55.237 --> 12:57.907
Now all we can do
is hope luck is in our favor.

12:58.827 --> 13:01.707
While battling
the second Golden Raana,

13:01.787 --> 13:03.877
Ruche tried seven times in a row

13:03.957 --> 13:05.917
and still couldn't manage
to roll a six.

13:06.877 --> 13:09.337
I know that streak
doesn't mean anything,

13:10.297 --> 13:11.167
but...

13:12.387 --> 13:14.797
probability converges.

13:14.887 --> 13:16.297
Dice Thrust!

13:16.387 --> 13:18.057
[ELYMAS]
We'll just get one chance.

13:18.137 --> 13:19.267
[grunts]

13:19.347 --> 13:20.347
[ELYMAS] Please!

13:21.307 --> 13:22.687
[straining]

13:28.527 --> 13:30.277
[grunts]

13:30.357 --> 13:31.647
-[Ruche gasps]
-[AUTOMATED VOICE] Miss.

13:31.737 --> 13:32.737
[gasps sharply]

13:33.567 --> 13:34.657
[gasps]

13:35.577 --> 13:37.527
[Embryo laughs]

13:37.617 --> 13:39.037
[grunts tensely]

13:39.117 --> 13:40.457
[Embryo laughing]

13:43.997 --> 13:46.167
Dice Thrust!

13:46.247 --> 13:47.957
[ELYMAS]
We'll just get one chance.

13:48.047 --> 13:49.957
- [Ruche grunts]
-[ELYMAS] Please!

13:50.837 --> 13:52.797
[straining]

13:56.597 --> 13:57.677
[grunts]

13:58.717 --> 14:00.057
-[Ruche gasps]
-[AUTOMATED VOICE] Miss.

14:00.137 --> 14:01.177
[both gasp sharply]

14:01.847 --> 14:03.227
[Embryo laughs]

14:03.307 --> 14:04.637
[grunts tensely]

14:04.727 --> 14:06.267
[Embryo laughing]

14:08.647 --> 14:10.067
[ELYMAS] We failed.

14:11.187 --> 14:12.857
Though this may
have been the only way,

14:13.817 --> 14:16.117
it was reckless of us
to put it all on the line

14:16.197 --> 14:18.117
and gamble with our own lives.

14:19.327 --> 14:21.287
-What'll we do?
-[Embryo continues laughing]

14:22.117 --> 14:24.077
[ELYMAS] How are we
supposed to survive?

14:28.207 --> 14:29.207
[clinks]

14:29.287 --> 14:31.917
[grunts]
I can't start giving up now.

14:35.047 --> 14:37.467
I need to at least tank
the Tin Knights.

14:37.547 --> 14:39.047
Then Ruche can land safely.

14:40.097 --> 14:41.057
[grunts]

14:42.727 --> 14:44.177
[Ruche grunts]

14:44.727 --> 14:45.727
[gasps]

14:49.897 --> 14:52.437
[RUCHE] Acrobatic Amble!

14:52.527 --> 14:54.437
[grunting]

14:55.777 --> 14:57.447
♪

14:57.527 --> 14:58.447
[gasps]

14:58.527 --> 15:00.697
[Ruche grunts] Here it comes!

15:00.777 --> 15:01.697
[Embryo gasps]

15:02.367 --> 15:04.827
It's time for my final...

15:04.907 --> 15:08.787
Dice Thrust!

15:08.877 --> 15:11.247
[Embryo screams]

15:11.337 --> 15:13.707
[yelling]

15:13.797 --> 15:15.547
[chuckles]

15:15.627 --> 15:18.007
[Embryo groans]

15:19.597 --> 15:21.007
[thuds]

15:28.557 --> 15:29.517
[thuds]

15:40.657 --> 15:41.737
[Ruche grunts]

15:43.907 --> 15:47.457
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
2,117 EXP acquired.

15:47.537 --> 15:49.997
Level 39 has been reached.

15:50.667 --> 15:52.587
[ELYMAS]
Now I'm beginning to realize.

15:53.247 --> 15:55.257
I made one big mistake.

15:55.337 --> 15:57.257
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Level 41 has been reached.

15:57.337 --> 15:59.177
[♪ gentle music playing]

15:59.257 --> 16:00.387
[ELYMAS]
The only thing I could do

16:00.467 --> 16:02.177
was hold out hope

16:02.257 --> 16:04.717
and pray that luck
would be on Ruche's side.

16:05.597 --> 16:07.677
But when things didn't go
as planned,

16:08.307 --> 16:09.897
she managed to press on

16:09.977 --> 16:11.147
and seize victory

16:11.857 --> 16:13.317
regardless of the odds.

16:14.357 --> 16:15.317
[gasps]

16:15.397 --> 16:18.527
Did I really beat it myself?

16:19.447 --> 16:20.777
[gasps]

16:20.867 --> 16:23.777
[Elymas chuckles softly] Ruche.

16:23.867 --> 16:25.157
[gasps]

16:25.237 --> 16:27.787
I would be dead right now
if it weren't for you.

16:27.867 --> 16:29.117
So I want to thank you.

16:30.117 --> 16:31.997
[whimpering]

16:32.077 --> 16:33.877
[chuckles softly]

16:33.957 --> 16:35.047
[gasps]

16:35.127 --> 16:38.127
Uh, you do? No problem!

16:38.217 --> 16:41.007
After all the time we've spent
exploring this dungeon together,

16:41.087 --> 16:43.757
I think it's really boosted
my confidence a lot.

16:43.847 --> 16:46.507
People always said my class
was completely useless

16:46.597 --> 16:48.057
and called us no good.

16:48.137 --> 16:51.307
But you and I have still found
a bunch of items out here.

16:51.387 --> 16:52.807
Even Dice Thrust helped.

16:52.897 --> 16:55.017
-But more than that...
-[gasps]

16:55.687 --> 16:56.567
Huh?

16:58.687 --> 16:59.947
...thanks for being you.

17:00.647 --> 17:02.447
[squeals]

17:02.527 --> 17:04.077
♪

17:04.157 --> 17:05.407
[laughs]

17:05.487 --> 17:07.327
Cline really screwed up,
didn't he?

17:07.407 --> 17:09.037
[Ruche giggles]

17:10.407 --> 17:11.787
[ELYMAS]
I'd only been judging people

17:11.867 --> 17:14.247
by their different classes
and levels as well.

17:15.797 --> 17:16.877
In that regard,

17:16.957 --> 17:19.587
I'm no different
from my father or Cline.

17:19.667 --> 17:21.007
I was just applying

17:21.087 --> 17:22.547
different standards
than they do.

17:23.797 --> 17:25.007
[sighs]

17:26.177 --> 17:28.387
When I was being stubborn,

17:28.467 --> 17:30.977
Ruche risked her life
to come back and rescue me.

17:32.767 --> 17:34.807
On top of that,
her quick thinking

17:34.897 --> 17:37.317
turned a desperate situation
around.

17:37.397 --> 17:40.107
And she single-handedly
defeated the Embryo.

17:43.697 --> 17:46.157
Grateful and devoted,

17:46.867 --> 17:49.367
she's able to perform
far beyond her limits

17:49.447 --> 17:50.367
when it counts the most.

17:53.957 --> 17:57.037
There's nobody who's more
dependable than you are.

17:57.127 --> 18:00.917
Oh, come on now.
I'm not that great. [giggles]

18:01.007 --> 18:03.427
You're so silly, Mr. Elymas.
[giggles]

18:07.177 --> 18:08.137
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
"The Upsetter" title

18:08.217 --> 18:09.347
has been acquired.

18:09.807 --> 18:12.097
Defeat a Dreamlord with a party
of two members or less

18:12.177 --> 18:15.267
at a level 70% or lower
than the recommended level.

18:16.057 --> 18:18.477
Attack and Speed increase by 15%

18:18.567 --> 18:21.607
when engaging in battle
against higher-level enemies.

18:23.487 --> 18:25.407
♪

18:27.527 --> 18:28.777
[ELYMAS] This title is acquired

18:28.867 --> 18:30.827
by defeating Dreamlords
at low level.

18:32.537 --> 18:35.077
Since it was essential
in Magic World,

18:35.167 --> 18:37.787
I was also planning
to get it here eventually.

18:38.417 --> 18:42.007
But I never imagined
I'd be receiving it so soon.

18:42.957 --> 18:45.297
[RUCHE] Hey, look!
They dropped some items!

18:45.377 --> 18:47.217
Yay, two Tin Swords!

18:47.297 --> 18:49.307
-[cheering]
-[ELYMAS] What? Seriously?

18:49.387 --> 18:51.637
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Tin Sword. Level 35.

18:51.717 --> 18:56.557
Attack, plus nine.
Market price, 2,400,000 gold.

18:56.647 --> 18:58.357
A Tin Knight's sword.

18:58.437 --> 19:01.727
[ELYMAS] Seems like she's always
making it rain valuable items.

19:02.357 --> 19:06.197
The benefits of the Lady Luck
skill tree are absolutely huge.

19:07.367 --> 19:09.987
But it takes a lot of courage

19:10.077 --> 19:12.077
to walk around
with those equipped.

19:14.577 --> 19:17.327
Hopefully, the Embryo
dropped something good as well.

19:18.037 --> 19:19.207
-[Ruche cheering]
-Hey, Ruche.

19:20.127 --> 19:21.417
Did you notice a bow

19:21.497 --> 19:23.457
with a wind-type enchantment
skill over there?

19:23.547 --> 19:26.007
Well, I, uh, I'm not sure.

19:26.087 --> 19:27.927
It's one of the Embryo's drops.

19:28.927 --> 19:31.467
Guess I can't expect things
to go that well.

19:32.257 --> 19:33.427
-[magical whoosh]
-[Elymas gasps]

19:36.427 --> 19:37.937
A skill book?!

19:38.017 --> 19:39.057
[panting]

19:39.477 --> 19:41.687
Those have a way lower drop rate
than weapons.

19:41.767 --> 19:43.317
Unbelievable!

19:46.187 --> 19:48.907
This is for the Intermediate
Wind Magic skill tree,

19:49.407 --> 19:50.697
which should come in handy.

19:51.327 --> 19:52.327
[gasps]

19:52.907 --> 19:54.947
It's well known that Skill Books
are fairly expensive.

19:56.077 --> 19:57.907
And thanks
to the nobles hoarding them,

19:57.997 --> 20:00.077
their value
has shot up considerably.

20:01.837 --> 20:04.207
This is incredibly valuable!

20:04.297 --> 20:06.337
-What's going on, Mr. Elymas?
-[Elymas gasps]

20:06.417 --> 20:08.257
Why are you keeping
that item hidden?

20:08.877 --> 20:09.927
-[ELYMAS] Oh, sorry.
-Hmm?

20:10.717 --> 20:12.637
But we found something crazy.

20:12.717 --> 20:14.427
This'll really make us a target.

20:15.597 --> 20:17.347
To avoid drawing attention,

20:17.427 --> 20:19.437
we'll have to sell it
to that old woman.

20:19.517 --> 20:21.437
-[rumbling]
-[Ruche gasps]

20:22.147 --> 20:23.437
[exclaims]

20:24.477 --> 20:25.437
[gasps]

20:34.367 --> 20:37.997
[gasps] Mr. Elymas, what's this?

20:38.077 --> 20:41.037
Don't worry.
The Dreamlord was defeated,

20:41.127 --> 20:42.877
so the dungeon's
disappearing now.

20:43.497 --> 20:45.497
We'll be back outside
before you know it.

20:46.167 --> 20:47.377
[RUCHE] Are you serious?

20:48.257 --> 20:49.917
That was pretty scary.

20:50.007 --> 20:52.047
All of this
is still really new to me.

20:55.137 --> 20:58.677
Oh, should probably wait
to say this, but...

20:58.767 --> 20:59.767
What?

21:00.437 --> 21:01.437
Since we've been here,

21:01.517 --> 21:03.557
we've earned
over 60 million gold.

21:05.187 --> 21:06.147
Huh?

21:06.727 --> 21:09.437
[ELYMAS] Yeah. That's just
a rough estimate, though.

21:11.947 --> 21:14.577
[gasps]

21:15.407 --> 21:16.867
[whimpers]

21:16.947 --> 21:18.657
Ruche, are you okay?

21:19.247 --> 21:20.407
Hey, what's wrong?

21:20.497 --> 21:21.657
You... You were right.

21:21.747 --> 21:23.877
You really should've waited
to tell me that.

21:23.957 --> 21:24.837
[gasps]

21:25.627 --> 21:26.497
[chuckles]

21:40.887 --> 21:42.847
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:10.567 --> 23:12.277
[ELYMAS] Thanks to Ruche,

23:12.357 --> 23:14.107
we were able
to defeat the Embryo.

23:14.187 --> 23:16.067
She's such an incredible ally.

23:16.907 --> 23:19.067
And she's managed to bring me
even closer to acquiring

23:19.157 --> 23:21.577
a Fang of Smoldering Insanity
Skill Book.

23:22.077 --> 23:25.287
At this point, I just need
to get a few more items,

23:25.367 --> 23:27.457
and I'll have 50 million gold.

23:27.537 --> 23:29.457
But something tells me
that greedy old woman

23:29.537 --> 23:30.877
isn't going to make it easy,

23:30.957 --> 23:33.167
even when I finally
do have enough to buy it.

23:33.247 --> 23:35.627
Next time, "Negotiation."

23:36.087 --> 23:37.717
For now, it's time for us

23:37.797 --> 23:39.847
to celebrate
beating the dungeon.
